            "heading_size": "h3",
            "seo_heading": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Review summary from Truspilot: \"Reviewers overwhelmingly had a great experience with this company. Customers frequently commend the high quality and vibrant colors of the t-shirts, particularly the tie-dye designs. Many appreciate that the shirts fit true to size and maintain their colors even after washing. Consumers also highlight the excellent quality of the screen prints on graphic shirts.<br/><br/>The company's customer service receives high praise, with reviewers noting the prompt, friendly, and informative responses from representatives like Abby, Faith and Jade.\" </p>"
